    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for counting tokens in a text string. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implement this to wrap tiktoken, SentencePiece, or any other tokenizer. The default implementation (<computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_char_division_counter" kindref="compound">CharDivisionCounter</ref></computeroutput>) divides character count by 4, which approximates GPT-style BPE token counts on English text with ≤10% error at the 95th percentile. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
